# False positive. EvidenceTrail sets KMSKeyId to LabKmsKey, a customer managed
# key in this template. Trivy 0.75 reads the property KmsKeyId and misses the
# CloudFormation name KMSKeyId, so it reports that the trail has no customer
# managed key. Renaming the property would make the template invalid. The lab
# lesson is CMK-encrypted CloudTrail evidence.
AWS-0015

# Deliberate teaching point. WorkloadSecurityGroup allows egress TCP 443 to
# 0.0.0.0/0 so the lab can show a narrow port with a still-open destination.
# Closing that egress would change the lesson.
AWS-0104
